  m_Name: WhatTheOldWoodFears
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SafeHaven::QuestDefinition
  id: whattheoldwoodfears
  displayName: What the Old Wood Fears
  description: 'The portal knows the guardian under the roots. It is old wood, and old wood fears one thing: fire. The Misty Woods'' trees weep a black sap when they fall. Boil it down around an ember from your hearth, rub it on your blade, and every blow will burn.'
  chain: The Hearth and the Door
  journalNotes: 'Fell trees in the Misty Woods: about half of them weep Cursed Sap. Two of it and a Hearth Ember make Ember Pitch at any campfire. Use it from the bag like a tonic: for five minutes your blows carry fire, and now and then set what they strike alight. A fight with the Heartroot lasts longer than one coat: bring two.'
  rank: 2
